From 38ea08f52c0dcf39bccca1a5e552c698e55a0d21 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: JU <jusamuel@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 10:04:28 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] feat(desktop): serial/tcp/virtual transports, simulator and
 link supervisor (C2)

- ITransport/TransportBase: background receive loop, Faulted on read/write error or EOF
- TcpClientTransport (continuous receive), SerialTransport (System.IO.Ports, raw bytes)
- VirtualTransport + fault injection (drop, garbage, delay, fragment, disconnect, fail-open, seed)
- Generic ProfileSimulator + DeviceProfile JSON v1, built-in GTEC/ECHO/STREAM profiles
- LinkSupervisor + ReconnectPolicy (1,2,3s then 5s..60s backoff), TransportFactory (local config)
- Tests: loopback TCP, virtual scenarios, faults, reconnect, config/profile validation
- No server, DB, client, terminal or IPC change

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FuvmaMYDsqg8KmRxK7aHch
